              description: "As with surveillance equipment and fitness trackers, the electronics used in robotics are small and must satisfy small dimensional tolerances. Micro molded parts help reduce the weight of robotics while also helping them improve performance and function. Different applications of micro molded products in robotics include:",
              sublist: ["Sensor housings", "Switches and connectors", "Gears and actuators"],
              additional: "Acetal, PP, PC, PE, and acrylic are commonly used for micro molded parts in robotics."
